<title>AUSTRALIA: Costello says capex data on forecast for jobs.</title>
<headline>Costello says capex data on forecast for jobs.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Treasurer Peter Costello said on Monday that capital expenditure figures released earlier were consistent with the jobs forecast in the 1996/97 (June 30) budget released in August.  </p>
<p>&quot;We've said that over the course of the year there'd be two percent employment growth, we've had the September quarter which was 0.5 percent -- four times 0.5 equals two, so you can say that the evidence to day is consistent with that forecast,&quot; Costello told reporters.</p>
<p>Costello was commenting after the release of September quarter capital expenditure data showing a 0.9 percent rise in capex in the September quarter.</p>
<p>-- Canberra Bureau 61-6 273-2730</p>
